  m_Name: unit_830978
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Sun-kissed Tilith
  unitId: 830978
  unitNumber: 8648
  description: "After an untold number of world-hopping adventures and endless acts
    of derring-do, Tilith had to admit she was past due for a well-deserved break.
    Even the guardian goddess of humanity needs to recharge! And so it was that Tilith
    poured all her heart and soul into a wish\u2014and this time, something answered.Normally,
    such tales end in comical disaster at best and terrible tragedy at worst, but
    not for one so pure of heart and sincere intention. Following the burst of light
    and sound, the gentle caress of sunlight greeted the goddess, and an endless
    expanse of golden sand stretched out before her.This was it. This was the fabled
    Starfall Island she had wanted to visit with her Summoner! Though most would
    rightly question the exact details of how\u2014and more importantly, why\u2014one
    could so easily teleport to a destination seen only in the mind's eye, Tilith
    felt only bliss in that moment; not to mention an overwhelming desire to jump
    for joy. Legend has it that stars landed on the island to rest, and the stardust
    left in their wake seeped into the beaches, giving rise to the aptly named \"starsand.\"
    Unsurprisingly, this has given rise to the idea that the island brims with wish-granting
    magics.Soon, Tilith found other people on the island, no doubt here as part of
    an out-of-season holiday destination. With so many things to do, Tilith set off
    exploring. Memories are all the sweeter when experienced with friends, whether
    old or new! Surely there must be many, many memories waiting to be made on this
    island, and best of all, with her beloved Legendary Summoner..."
  summonDesc: We're here at last!<br>Finally, a holiday by the beach!<br>I'm so happy
    I could cry!
  fusionDesc: Mmm~ That really hit the spot!<br>How about another round?
  evoDesc: Oh! Did you see that?<br>Quick! Take my hand, and let's make a wish!
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
